    {
      "version": "1.18",
      "date": "2026-11-22",
      "title": "Nightmare AI vs Floating Discs, x4 defences",
      "description": "Nightmare AI: its defences now work without power and can't be drained by Floating Discs. It builds 4 times as many defences, each with 4 times the health. Once you own a Floating Disc it sends up to 3 anti-air patrols of 30 IFVs, 15 Flak Tracks or 30 Gattling tanks, each unit with 5 times the health (AI-only units; yours are unchanged). Everything from v1.17 stays.",
      "restart": true,
