    {
      "version": "1.17",
      "date": "2026-11-22",
      "title": "Nightmare AI: rally attacks, x3 defences",
      "description": "Nightmare AI changes: attack groups are normal size again, but they gather outside the AI base and wait 30 seconds before attacking, so several waves arrive together. The AI builds 3 times faster, gets 3 times the money and builds 3 times the base defences. It now has 4 war factories (was 6). Its units and buildings stay twice as tough with twice the damage, and spies and Floating Discs still work on its refineries.",
